Product and OS Dependencies:
-----------------------------
  The Cray gdb4hpc %VERSION% release is supported on the following Cray systems:
    - Cray XE/XK & XC with CLE 5.2 or later
    - Cray XC with CLE 6.0 or later
    - CentOS 7.x operating system on CS.
    - Native SLURM is supported with version 17
    - Cray XC ARM with CLE 6.0
      

  Product Dependencies:
    - craype 2.5.14 or later is required on Cray XC ARM systems running CLE 6.0.


Documentation:
---------------
Type `man gdb4hpc` with the gdb4hpc module loaded to read the gdb4hpc(1) man page.

Simple usage examples are provided at the end.

Also, type `help` at the gdb4hpc command line for more information on commands.


Installation instructions:
--------------------------

Installation instructions for %os_name%:
=============================================
  rpm -ivh %PREFIX% gdb4hpc-%VERSION%-%REVISION%-%RELEASE%%os%.%ARCH%.rpm

  To make gdb4hpc %VERSION% the default version of gdb4hpc, execute:
  %OSPREFIX%/admin-pe/set_default_files/set_default_gdb4hpc_%VERSION%


